<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-VIALBE WINS 10-KM PURSUIT GOLD.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-VIALBE WINS 10-KM PURSUIT GOLD.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian Yelena Vialbe won gold in the 10-km, freestyle pursuit cross-country race at the Nordic skiing world championships on Monday in a provisional time of 39 minutes 13.5 seconds.</p>
<p>Italian Stefania Belmondo was second with the same time as the winner and Russian Nina Gavrilyuk was third, 18.6 seconds behind, according to provisional results.</p>
